invalid type: string "Penal charges are extra charges for late payment or irregularity. For SBI, the penal charge is 2.40 percent per\nannum for irregularity up to 60 days, and 5 percent per annum beyond 60 days, applied on the irregular portion.\n\n12\\. GST\n\nGST is the Goods and Services Tax in India. It is added on top of fees and charges.\n\n13\\. Mortgage (Equitable and Registered)", expect